  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Expose the engine's CLI commands as a library module by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1847\n* Avoid unnecessary disk staging when paused resume inputs fit in tmpfs by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1849\n* Give machine create a window above the image pull deadline so a large image's seed build is not cut off at five minutes by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1848\n* Build a paused machine's export beside its data directory by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1850\n* Prepare SmolVM v1.30.1 for release by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1851\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/compare/v1.30.0...v1.30.1",
